infinite-patch 1
# Shape Resonator: short plucks ring a torus knot; the strike point moves along it.
# band Sound
node 1 Notes Random Note Generator
  id notes
  pos 0 990
  i scale minor pentatonic
  i root D
  i rangeLow 50
  i rangeHigh 74
  f rateBeats 0.5
end
node 2 Synths Analog
  id pluck
  pos 480 990
  i wave1 square
  f cutoff 3000
  f attack 1
  f decay 90
  f sustain 0
  f release 60
  f volume 0.6
end
node 3 3D Sphere
  id knot
  pos 0 0
  i shape Torus Knot
end
node 4 AudioEffects Shape Resonator
  id body
  pos 1340 1146
  f decay 3
  f damping 0.35
  f modes 24
  f mix 0.8
end
node 5 Modulators LFO
  id strike
  pos 0 2150
  f rateBeats 8
end
node 6 Utility Audio Out
  id speakers
  pos 1960 990
end
node 7 Compositing Comment
  pos 1340 990
  s text Shape Resonator rings the modes of the shape cabled into its second slot: a torus knot has a dense, bell-like set. The LFO moves the strike position along the shape over two bars, so the same pluck changes which modes it excites.
  f width 360
  f height 140
end
node 8 Source Shape
  id picture
  pos 0 430
  i shapeType Ring
end
node 9 Utility Output
  id out
  pos 460 0
end
note pluck 0 notes
aud body 0 pluck
geo body 1 knot
aud speakers 0 body
mod body pos strike 0 0 1 0.5
cable out 0 picture
